          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 79677,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Impariamo ad aggiungere e rimuovere valori da una lista. Come in questa app, che usa una lista per gestire i dati dei punteggi dell'utente.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;&#xA;&lt;head&gt;&#xA;    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;title&gt;Leaderboard&lt;/title&gt;&#xA;    &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;style&gt;&#xA;        body {&#xA;            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .leaderboard {&#xA;            width: 300px;&#xA;            border: 1px solid #ccc;&#xA;            border-radius: 5px;&#xA;            overflow: hidden;&#xA;            margin: 20px auto;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .leaderboard-header {&#xA;            background-color: #2b5188;&#xA;            color: white;&#xA;            padding: 10px;&#xA;            font-size: 16px;&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            justify-content: space-between;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .leaderboard-header .trophy {&#xA;            margin-left: 10px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .leaderboard-list {&#xA;            list-style: none;&#xA;            margin: 0;&#xA;            padding: 0;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .leaderboard-list li {&#xA;            padding: 10px;&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            justify-content: space-between;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xA;            border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .leaderboard-list li:nth-child(odd) {&#xA;            background-color: #f9f9f9;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .leaderboard-list li:last-child {&#xA;            border-bottom: none;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .position {&#xA;            font-size: 14px;&#xA;            color: #555;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .score {&#xA;            font-size: 14px;&#xA;            color: #333;&#xA;        }&#xA;    &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&quot;leaderboard&quot;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;leaderboard-header&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;ROUNDS WON&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span class=&quot;trophy&quot;&gt;4 &lt;i class=&quot;fas fa-trophy&quot; style=&quot;color: gold;&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;ul class=&quot;leaderboard-list&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;position&quot;&gt;4.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;score&quot;&gt;20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;position&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;score&quot;&gt;25&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;position&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;score&quot;&gt;23&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;position&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;score&quot;&gt;24&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "append()",
            "id": 79676,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per aggiungere il valore <code>25</code> a una lista, scriviamo il nome della lista seguito da un punto <code>.</code>, quindi l'istruzione <code>append(25)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"23\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores.append(\" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[24, 23, 25]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>append</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>25</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per aggiungere un valore alla fine di una lista, scriviamo il nome della lista, un punto <code>.</code> e il metodo <code>append</code> con il valore tra parentesi.</p><p>Aggiungi il numero <code>25</code> alla fine di <code>scores</code> in modo che stampi <code>[24, 23, 25]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"23\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores.append(\" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"insert\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;25&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[24, 23, 25]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>append</code>, seguito da <code>(</code>, <code>25</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "append()",
            "id": 79675,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungere un valore con <code>.append()</code> lo inserisce alla fine dell'elenco. Possiamo vedere il risultato qui scrivendo <code>print(users)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;john&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;hannah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;marco&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"users.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;julian&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['john', 'hannah', 'marco', 'julian']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>users</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungere un valore con <code>.append()</code> lo inserisce alla fine della lista.</p><p>Visualizza l'intera lista in modo che la console mostri <code>['john', 'hannah', 'marco', 'julian']</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;john&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;hannah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;marco&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"users.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;julian&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"append\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;julian&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['john', 'hannah', 'marco', 'julian']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>(</code>, <code>users</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "insert()",
            "id": 79674,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungiamo un valore a un indice specifico con <code>insert()</code>. Scrivendo <code>insert(0, \"lemon\")</code>, aggiungeremo il valore all'inizio della lista.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;kiwis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;peas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"shopping.insert(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(shopping)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['lemon', 'kiwis', 'peas']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>insert</code>, seguito da <code>(0, \"lemon\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungiamo un valore a un indice specifico con <code>insert()</code>. Il primo argomento è l'indice e il secondo è il valore.</p><p>Aggiungi <code>\"lemon\"</code> all'inizio di <code>shopping</code> in modo che stampi <code>['lemon', 'kiwis', 'peas']</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;kiwis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;peas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"shopping.insert(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(shopping)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"append\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;kiwis&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['lemon', 'kiwis', 'peas']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>insert</code>, seguito da <code>0</code> e infine <code>\"lemon\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Insert()",
            "id": 80441,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La funzione <code>insert()</code> ha due parametri. Prima, l'indice in cui vogliamo inserire il valore, seguito dal valore.</p><p><code>insert(1, \"chocolate\")</code> aggiunge un valore nella seconda posizione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;kiwis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;peas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"shopping.insert(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"shopping.insert(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(shopping)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"87\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['lemon', 'chocolate', 'kiwis', 'peas']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>insert</code>, seguito da <code>1</code> e poi <code>,</code>, <code>\"chocolate\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La funzione <code>insert()</code> ha due parametri: l'indice in cui inserire il valore e il valore stesso, separati da una virgola.</p><p>Inserisci <code>\"chocolate\"</code> come secondo elemento in modo che stampi <code>['lemon', 'chocolate', 'kiwis', 'peas']</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;kiwis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;peas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"shopping.insert(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"shopping.insert(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(shopping)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"append\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['lemon', 'chocolate', 'kiwis', 'peas']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>insert</code>, seguito da <code>1</code>, <code>,</code> e infine <code>\"chocolate\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "One at a time",
            "id": 79673,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per <code>append()</code> e <code>insert()</code>, possiamo aggiungere un solo elemento alla volta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"initials = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;RM&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;LP&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"initials.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;LC&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"initials.insert(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;LS&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(initials)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"61\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['RM', 'LS', 'LP', 'LC']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>append</code>, seguito da <code>insert</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per <code>append()</code> e <code>insert()</code>, possiamo aggiungere un solo elemento alla volta.</p><p>Aggiungi <code>\"LC\"</code> alla fine e <code>\"LS\"</code> all'indice <code>1</code>, in modo che stampi <code>['RM', 'LS', 'LP', 'LC']</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"initials = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;RM&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;LP&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"initials.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;LC&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"initials.insert(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;LS&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(initials)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['RM', 'LS', 'LP', 'LC']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>append</code>, seguito da <code>insert</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "pop()",
            "id": 79672,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per rimuovere l'ultimo elemento di una lista, scrivi il nome della lista <code>todo</code>, un punto <code>.</code> e l'istruzione <code>pop()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"todo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"todo.pop()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(todo)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"40\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['call mom']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>pop()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Store saved element",
            "id": 80443,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per rimuovere un valore a un indice specifico, aggiungiamo tra parentesi l'indice che vogliamo rimuovere, come in <code>pop(1)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"todo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;painting&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"todo.pop(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(todo)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['call mom', 'painting']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>pop</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>1</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa <code>pop()</code> per rimuovere un elemento della lista, inserendo il suo indice tra parentesi.</p><p>Rimuovi <code>\"dishes\"</code> in modo che la lista stampi <code>['call mom', 'painting']</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"todo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;painting&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"todo.pop(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(todo)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"append\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['call mom', 'painting']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>pop</code>, seguito da <code>(</code>, <code>1</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Stored",
            "id": 80489,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il valore rimosso può essere memorizzato anche in una variabile. Possiamo vederlo qui quando scriviamo <code>print(removed)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"todo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;painting&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"removed = todo.pop(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(removed)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"78\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"call mom\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>print(removed)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Append",
            "id": 79671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale istruzione usiamo per aggiungere un valore a una lista?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.append()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.pop()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>.append()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usiamo <code>.append()</code> per aggiungere un valore a una lista.</p><p>Quale codice aggiunge <code>\"tea\"</code> a <code>drinks</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>drinks.append(\"tea\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>drinks.pop(\"tea\")</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>append.drinks(\"tea\")</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>drinks.append(\"tea\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: End of the list",
            "id": 79670,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dove va un nuovo valore che aggiungiamo con <code>.append()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Alla fine dell'elenco</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">All'inizio dell'elenco</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Alla fine dell'elenco.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un valore aggiunto con <code>.append()</code> viene inserito alla fine della lista.</p><p>Dopo <code>colors = [\"red\", \"blue\"]</code> e <code>colors.append(\"green\")</code>, che cosa contiene <code>colors</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"red\", \"blue\", \"green\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"green\", \"red\", \"blue\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"red\", \"green\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>[\"red\", \"blue\", \"green\"]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: More values",
            "id": 79669,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quanti valori alla volta possiamo aggiungere a una lista usando <code>.append()</code> e <code>.insert()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un valore alla volta</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Quanti ne vogliamo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un valore alla volta.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ogni chiamata a <code>.append()</code> o <code>.insert()</code> aggiunge un valore alla volta.</p><p>Vuoi che <code>\"tea\"</code> e <code>\"water\"</code> diventino due elementi separati. Che cosa dovresti fare?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Chiamare <code>.append()</code> una volta per ogni valore.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Passare entrambi i valori come argomenti separati in una sola chiamata a <code>.append()</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Aggiungere una lista contenente entrambi i valori per creare due elementi separati.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Chiamare <code>.append()</code> una volta per ogni valore.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pop",
            "id": 79668,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale istruzione usiamo per rimuovere l'ultimo elemento di una lista?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.pop()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.insert()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>.pop()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiamare <code>.pop()</code> senza un indice rimuove l'ultimo elemento di una lista.</p><p>Per <code>plans = [\"work\", \"eat\", \"sleep\"]</code>, quale codice rimuove <code>\"sleep\"</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>plans.pop()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>plans.insert()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>plans.pop(0)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>plans.pop()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Store removed element",
            "id": 79667,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come possiamo salvare il valore rimosso da <code>.pop()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Memorizzandolo in una variabile</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non possiamo salvarlo: <code>.pop()</code> non ci restituisce un valore</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Memorizzandolo in una variabile.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Senza un indice, <code>.pop()</code> rimuove e restituisce l'ultimo elemento, quindi puoi memorizzarlo in una variabile.</p><p>Per <code>queue = [\"Ada\", \"Ben\"]</code>, quale codice rimuove <code>\"Ben\"</code> e lo memorizza in <code>removed_user</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>removed_user = queue.pop()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>queue.pop() = removed_user</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>removed_user = queue</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>removed_user = queue.pop()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: End of the list",
            "id": 79665,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi <code>\"sugar\"</code> alla fine della lista scrivendo <code>append(\"sugar\")</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cookies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"cookies.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cookies)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"53\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['flour', 'butter', 'sugar']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>append(\"sugar\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
